     {
         "title": "Hollywood live-action Naruto movie has found its Third Hokage, reports say",
         "description": "The Hollywood Naruto wants this famous Japanese actor to get over here. Back in July, the producers of the upcoming Hollywood live-action adaptation of ninja anime/manga Naruto announced that they were launching a worldwide search for actors to play the story’s central trio of Naruto, Sasuka, and Sakura. While those roles have yet to be [\u0026#8230;]",
         "content": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-750890\" src=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/2_b4922e.jpg?w=640\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" srcset=\"https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/2_b4922e.jpg 1024w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/2_b4922e.jpg?resize=150,84 150w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/2_b4922e.jpg?resize=640,360 640w, https://soranews24.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/2_b4922e.jpg?resize=768,432 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: large\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Hollywood Naruto wants this famous Japanese actor to get over here\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan id=\"more-750888\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBack in July, the producers of the upcoming Hollywood live-action adaptation of ninja anime/manga \u003cstrong\u003eNaruto\u003c/strong\u003e announced that they were launching \u003ca href=\"https://soranews24.com/2026/07/10/hollywood-live-action-naruto-movie-announces-global-search-for-its-naruto-sasuke-and-sakura/\"\u003ea worldwide search for actors to play the story’s central trio of Naruto, Sasuka, and Sakura\u003c/a\u003e. While those roles have yet to be decided, it appears that the movie has decided on who to cast as \u003cstrong\u003eHiruzen Sarutobi\u003c/strong\u003e, and it’s someone cinema fans on both sides of the Pacific are very familiar with.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLionsgate is reportedly in the final stages of negotiation with Japanese actor\u003cstrong\u003e Hiroyuki Sanada\u003c/strong\u003e to play the part of the wise leader of Konohagakure who also serves as a mentor to the young shinobi-in-training.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e▼ Hiroyuki Sanada (left) and Hiruzen Sarutobi (right)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" align=\"center\" data-width=\"550\" data-lang=\"en\" data-dnt=\"true\" data-partner=\"jetpack\"\u003e\u003cp lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003eこれははまり役の予感！\u003cbr\u003e猿飛ヒルゼン役に真田広之さん \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/Hy97oeKevI\"\u003ehttps://t.co/Hy97oeKevI\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/vAyEGHGceF\"\u003epic.twitter.com/vAyEGHGceF\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u0026mdash; 目頭 (@Awakend_Citizen) \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/Awakend_Citizen/status/2125107808614121639?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003eNovember 24, 2026\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSanada has become one of the most successful and prolific Japanese actors to be involved in Hollywood productions. Though he started out as a child actor in Japan and spent the first part of his career working only in domestic film, TV, and stage roles, Sanada did a stint with the Royal Shakespeare Company at the turn of the millennium, and his \u003cstrong\u003eexcellent command of the English language\u003c/strong\u003e helped him secure significant speaking roles in \u003cem\u003eThe Last Samurai\u003c/em\u003e and both the \u003cem\u003eRush Hour\u003c/em\u003e and \u003cem\u003eJohn Wick\u003c/em\u003e franchises.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e▼ Sanada being interviewed in English while promoting \u003cem\u003eJohn Wick 4\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" align=\"center\" data-width=\"550\" data-lang=\"en\" data-dnt=\"true\" data-partner=\"jetpack\"\u003e\u003cp lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e真田さん「あの話していい？」\u003cbr\u003eキアヌ「例のピシピシ？」\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e満身創痍のベテラン達が撮影現場で使っていた秘密兵器について2人が教えてくれます。真田さんとキアヌめっちゃ仲良しで癒し\u003cimg src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f436.png\" alt=\"🐶\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E7%9C%9F%E7%94%B0%E5%BA%83%E4%B9%8B?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003e#真田広之\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/johnwick4?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003e#johnwick4\u003c/a\u003e  \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026#39;John Wick 4\u0026#39; Hiroyuki Sanada \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/wOI6VAUg3v\"\u003ehttps://t.co/wOI6VAUg3v\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/yRlVfba786\"\u003epic.twitter.com/yRlVfba786\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u0026mdash; 塁（RUI） (@ruitaroro) \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/ruitaroro/status/1639102266140692481?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003eMarch 24, 2023\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSanada’s most recent high-profile roles have been as samurai warlord Toranaga in FX’s 2001 adaptation of James Clavell’s \u003cem\u003eShogun\u003c/em\u003e and as undead martial artist Scorpion in the ongoing \u003cem\u003eMortal Kombat\u003c/em\u003e movie series reboot\u003c/strong\u003e. He’s also appeared in a long list of samurai and ninja films in Japan, so it shouldn’t be too hard for him to bring a sense of experienced calm to his portrayal as the veteran Third Hokage Sarutobi.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e▼ By the Naurto’s adventures are starting, Sarutobi looks quite a bit older than Sanada does, so the live-action \u003cem\u003eNaruto\u003c/em\u003e might be aiming for his comparatively more youthful design seen on the left here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" align=\"center\" data-width=\"550\" data-lang=\"en\" data-dnt=\"true\" data-partner=\"jetpack\"\u003e\u003cp lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e三代目のじいちゃん！\u003cbr\u003e誕生日おめでとうございます！\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e火の意志は脈々と\u003cbr\u003e受け継がれてます！\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/NARUTO?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003e#NARUTO\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E7%8C%BF%E9%A3%9B%E3%83%92%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BC%E3%83%B3%E7%94%9F%E8%AA%95%E7%A5%AD2019?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003e#猿飛ヒルゼン生誕祭2019\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E7%8C%BF%E9%A3%9B%E3%83%92%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BC%E3%83%B3%E7%94%9F%E8%AA%95%E7%A5%AD?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003e#猿飛ヒルゼン生誕祭\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/tqc8FpTCsa\"\u003epic.twitter.com/tqc8FpTCsa\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u0026mdash; BORUtomo\u003cimg src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f529.png\" alt=\"🔩\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /\u003e (@NSSBSMK007) \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/NSSBSMK007/status/1093793181664071681?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\"\u003eFebruary 8, 2019\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe live-action \u003cem\u003eNaruto\u003c/em\u003e is slated to start filming this coming spring.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eSource: \u003ca href=\"https://www.cinematoday.jp/news/N0158124\"\u003eCinema Today\u003c/a\u003e via \u003ca href=\"http://blog.esuteru.com/archives/10588701.html\"\u003eHachima Kiko\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://deadline.com/2026/11/shogun-hiroyuki-sanada-destin-daniel-cretton-naruto-movie-1237231404/\"\u003eDeadline\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cem\u003eTop image: \u003ca href=\"https://naruto-official.com/en/news/01_2649\"\u003eNaruto official website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e● Want to hear about SoraNews24\u0026#8217;s latest articles as soon as they\u0026#8217;re published? \u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/RocketNews24En\"\u003eFollow us on Facebook\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://twitter.com/RocketNews24En\"\u003eTwitter\u003c/a\u003e!\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n",
